# Secrets, rendered output and the operator's own inputs. Only the templates
# and the examples are committed, so a box's checkout stays clean and
# auto-apply.sh can keep fast-forwarding it.
#
# provider.toml is in this list twice over: it is rendered, AND it carries this
# provider's Nostr private key inline. The repository root's .gitignore already
# refuses `/provider.toml`; this one refuses the rendered copy here.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
provider.toml
connector.toml
# What this provider sells. listings.example.toml is committed; the copy an
# operator makes theirs is not.
listings.toml
operator-bearer.token
operator-write.keys
# Public, but rendered from settlement-solana.key on the box (render.sh).
settlement-solana.address
nginx/conf.d/
*.key
*.secret
# The last commit auto-apply.sh applied AND verified (TOON_Network#160).
# Written only on success, so it never carries this operator's history.
.applied
# Python bytecode, should anything ever import keys.py rather than run it.
__pycache__/
